  "docs": {
    "readme": "README.md",
    "extra": [],
    "summary": "Next.js SaaS Starter This is a starter template for building a SaaS application using **Next.js** with support for authentication, Stripe integration for payments, and a dashboard for logged-in users. **Demo: [https://next-saas-start.vercel.app/](https://next-saas-start.vercel.app/)** Features - Marketing landing page (`/`) with animated Terminal element - Pricing page (`/pricing`) which connects to Stripe Checkout - Dashboard pages with CRUD operations on users/teams - Basic RBAC with Owner and Member roles"
  },
